    "detailed_description": "Brush Burial is a lite immersive sim focused on atmosphere, exploration, and surreal storytelling.<br>You are Fennel, a lithe and limber thief with a suite of unique movement tricks and combat abilities. You are on a mission that transcends the self-serving crimes of your past--to kill the Witch God Yenneloch, and free the woods of her uncanny influence. In return, your own god has promised you a sacred rite of eternal rest. Unless you have other ideas...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676540/extras/9a3ba9c4da7d438e5ad236cdcd740c3d.poster.avif?t=1701417890\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676540/extras/9a3ba9c4da7d438e5ad236cdcd740c3d.gif?t=1701417890\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>FEATURES:<br><br>- abstract and non-linear levels that allow for exploration and satisfying problem-solving.<br><br>- meaningful environmental interactions--grab any object you want; play with fire; use the weapons of slain enemies against their allies.<br><br>- an expressive movement system with responsive and precise controls.<br><br>- raw but complex melee combat which rewards aggression and speed.<br><br>- grimy visuals with a dark science-fantasy slant.<br><br>- a roguish array of crooks, scoundrels, and miscreants to befriend, beguile, or otherwise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676540/extras/390f01df1f933a35fb466e0367138658.poster.avif?t=1701417890\" width=500 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676540/extras/390f01df1f933a35fb466e0367138658.webm?t=1701417890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676540/extras/390f01df1f933a35fb466e0367138658.mp4?t=1701417890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
